@startuml Chat with Customers Sequence Diagram

!theme plain
title Chat with Customers Use Case\n(צ'אט עם הלקוחות)

actor "Customer\n(לקוח)" as Customer
actor "Seller\n(מוכר)" as Seller
actor "Admin\n(מנהל)" as Admin
participant "Chat Component\n(רכיב צ'אט)" as ChatComponent
participant "Chat Reducer\n(Redux)" as ChatReducer
participant "Socket.IO\n(WebSocket)" as Socket
participant "API Layer" as API
participant "Chat Controller" as ChatController
participant "Seller Customer Message\n(MongoDB)" as SellerCustomerMsg
participant "Admin Seller Message\n(MongoDB)" as AdminSellerMsg
participant "Seller Customer Model\n(MongoDB)" as SellerCustomerModel

== Customer-Seller Chat ==

Customer -> ChatComponent: Open chat with seller\n(פתיחת צ'אט עם מוכר)
activate ChatComponent

ChatComponent -> ChatReducer: dispatch(add_customer_friend({sellerId, userId}))
activate ChatReducer

ChatReducer -> API: POST /api/chat/customer/add-customer-friend
activate API

API -> ChatController: add_customer_friend(req, res)
activate ChatController

ChatController -> SellerCustomerModel: Check if friendship exists\n(בדיקה אם חברות קיימת)
activate SellerCustomerModel

alt Friendship doesn't exist
    SellerCustomerModel -> SellerCustomerModel: Add seller to customer's friends\n(הוספת מוכר לחברים של לקוח)
    SellerCustomerModel -> SellerCustomerModel: Add customer to seller's friends\n(הוספת לקוח לחברים של מוכר)
else Friendship exists
    SellerCustomerModel --> ChatController: Friendship already exists\n(חברות כבר קיימת)
end

SellerCustomerModel --> ChatController: Friendship established\n(חברות הוקמה)
deactivate SellerCustomerModel

ChatController --> API: 201 - Friend added successfully
deactivate ChatController

API --> ChatReducer: Success response
deactivate API

ChatReducer --> ChatComponent: Friend relationship established
deactivate ChatReducer

Customer -> ChatComponent: Type and send message\n(הקלדה ושליחת הודעה)

ChatComponent -> ChatReducer: dispatch(customer_message_add({userId, text, sellerId, name}))
activate ChatReducer

ChatReducer -> API: POST /api/chat/customer/send-message-to-seller
activate API

API -> ChatController: customer_message_add(req, res)
activate ChatController

ChatController -> SellerCustomerMsg: create({senderId: userId, receverId: sellerId, message: text})
activate SellerCustomerMsg
SellerCustomerMsg --> ChatController: Message saved\n(הודעה נשמרה)
deactivate SellerCustomerMsg

ChatController -> ChatController: updateFriendsOrder()\nfor both users\n(עדכון סדר חברים לשני המשתמשים)

ChatController --> API: 201 - Message sent successfully
deactivate ChatController

API --> ChatReducer: Success response
deactivate API

ChatReducer -> Socket: Emit message to seller\n(שליחת הודעה למוכר דרך WebSocket)
activate Socket

Socket --> Seller: Real-time message notification\n(התראת הודעה בזמן אמת)

ChatReducer --> ChatComponent: Message added to chat
deactivate ChatReducer

ChatComponent --> Customer: Display sent message\n(הצגת הודעה שנשלחה)

== Seller Response ==

Seller -> ChatComponent: View customer message\n(צפייה בהודעת לקוח)

Seller -> ChatComponent: Type and send reply\n(הקלדה ושליחת תגובה)

ChatComponent -> ChatReducer: dispatch(customer_message_add({userId: sellerId, text, receverId: customerId, name}))
activate ChatReducer

ChatReducer -> API: POST /api/chat/seller/send-message-to-customer
activate API

API -> ChatController: customer_message_add(req, res)
activate ChatController

ChatController -> SellerCustomerMsg: create({senderId: sellerId, receverId: customerId, message: text})
activate SellerCustomerMsg
SellerCustomerMsg --> ChatController: Reply saved\n(תגובה נשמרה)
deactivate SellerCustomerMsg

ChatController --> API: 201 - Reply sent successfully
deactivate ChatController

API --> ChatReducer: Success response
deactivate API

ChatReducer -> Socket: Emit reply to customer\n(שליחת תגובה ללקוח דרך WebSocket)

Socket --> Customer: Real-time reply notification\n(התראת תגובה בזמן אמת)
deactivate Socket

ChatReducer --> ChatComponent: Reply added to chat
deactivate ChatReducer

ChatComponent --> Seller: Display sent reply\n(הצגת תגובה שנשלחה)

== Admin-Seller Chat ==

Admin -> ChatComponent: Open chat with seller\n(פתיחת צ'אט עם מוכר)
activate ChatComponent

ChatComponent -> ChatReducer: dispatch(get_sellers())
activate ChatReducer

ChatReducer -> API: GET /api/chat/admin/get-sellers
activate API

API -> ChatController: get_sellers(req, res)
activate ChatController

ChatController -> SellerCustomerModel: find({}) - Get all sellers\n(קבלת כל המוכרים)
activate SellerCustomerModel
SellerCustomerModel --> ChatController: Sellers list\n(רשימת מוכרים)
deactivate SellerCustomerModel

ChatController --> API: 200 - Sellers list
deactivate ChatController

API --> ChatReducer: Success response with sellers
deactivate API

ChatReducer --> ChatComponent: Sellers list updated
deactivate ChatReducer

Admin -> ChatComponent: Select seller and send message\n(בחירת מוכר ושליחת הודעה)

ChatComponent -> ChatReducer: dispatch(send_message_seller_admin({senderId: '', receverId: sellerId, message, senderName: 'Admin Support'}))
activate ChatReducer

ChatReducer -> API: POST /api/chat/message-send-seller-admin
activate API

API -> ChatController: seller_admin_message_insert(req, res)
activate ChatController

ChatController -> AdminSellerMsg: create({senderId: '', receverId: sellerId, message, senderName})
activate AdminSellerMsg
AdminSellerMsg --> ChatController: Admin message saved\n(הודעת מנהל נשמרה)
deactivate AdminSellerMsg

ChatController --> API: 200 - Admin message sent
deactivate ChatController

API --> ChatReducer: Success response
deactivate API

ChatReducer -> Socket: Emit message to seller\n(שליחת הודעה למוכר)
activate Socket

Socket --> Seller: Admin message notification\n(התראת הודעת מנהל)
deactivate Socket

ChatReducer --> ChatComponent: Admin message added
deactivate ChatReducer

ChatComponent --> Admin: Display sent message\n(הצגת הודעה שנשלחה)

deactivate ChatComponent

note right of Socket
  WebSocket (Socket.IO) enables:
  - Real-time message delivery
  - Online status indicators
  - Typing indicators
  - Message read receipts
  - Push notifications
  
  (WebSocket מאפשר:
  מסירת הודעות בזמן אמת,
  מחווני סטטוס, התראות)
end note

note right of ChatController
  Chat system supports:
  - Customer ↔ Seller communication
  - Admin ↔ Seller communication
  - Message history persistence
  - Friend relationship management
  - Real-time notifications
  
  (מערכת צ'אט תומכת ב:
  תקשורת לקוח-מוכר, מנהל-מוכר,
  שמירת היסטוריה, ניהול חברויות)
end note

@enduml
